Article 5 (Members)
(1) Members shall be commissioned by the Minister of the National Court Administration from among the following persons: <Amended on May 1, 2020>
1. Judges;
2. Court officials of Grade III or higher;
3. Prosecutors;
4. Attorneys-at-law;
5. Professors;
6. Experts in relevant fields, such as geography, civil engineering, urban planning, design, structural engineering, mechanical engineering, electrical engineering, architectural planning, architectural design, urban planning, and landscaping;
7. Other persons necessary to implement courthouse construction work.
(2) The term of office of a member shall be one year: Provided, That the Minister of the National Court Administration may replace members as necessary.
